    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d273-a2">

                <pb facs="0471" n="401" xml:id="pg401"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 26, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In virtue of the conference which you held with me this morning, in behalf of
                    American citizens resident in this capital, whose protection is commended to
                    you, I manifest that, acceding to your desires, no forced loan nor any other
                    service shall in the future be imposed upon them.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>VIDAURRI, <hi rendition="#italic">The President of the Ministry and
                            Minister of France.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marcus Otterbourg,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul of the United States.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
